#%PAM-1.0
# The lock screen always runs a smartcard check next to the password. The
# stock service asks pam_sss, which Raye does not ship, so every lock
# logged "PAM adding faulty module: pam_sss.so". Raye has no smartcard
# sign-in: say no at once, quietly. This file wins over
# /usr/lib/pam.d/kde-smartcard.
auth     requisite  pam_deny.so
account  requisite  pam_deny.so
password requisite  pam_deny.so
session  requisite  pam_deny.so
